rewritten-to-match
Same recursion and the same tree, a pool item per node made by `add` as the reference makes a Box per node. A node names its children by slot + 1 (0 for none) where the reference holds Option<Box<TreeNode>>, and following one is an index into the pool (checked live); dropping the tree at the end of a run is coll.clear() (the reference drops the Box tree). Other stores are checked and undo-logged. Scratch state rebuilt every run (the reference's locals: nodes) is declared `unlogged`, kept out of the undo log.
